OpenFlights sample data
-----------------------

`inst/extdata/openflights_top20_airports.csv` and
`inst/extdata/openflights_top20_routes.csv` are derived from OpenFlights data.
The databases are available under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0 and
their individual contents under the Database Contents License (DbCL) v1.0.
Source URLs, attribution, and license URLs are in
`inst/extdata/openflights-README.md`.

